      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Mikhail(17)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Elder Yaro adopted grandson / War Orphan】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A Youngster from the village, he is Elder Yaro adopted grandson and a childhood friend of Vila.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Lesnimir Youth</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Mikhail, Vila, Pavel and Petra are all childhood friend and youths who grew up alongside each other in Lesnimir. They enjoy playing and the company of each other.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Torn heart</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Mikhail harbors some feeling for his adopted sister Vila, after she has been accused as a Witch and fled the village, Mikhail still wanted to help her out somehow despite knowing the danger that presents.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>The Next Village Chief</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">As Elder Yaro adopted grandson, he is expected to take on the mantle of village chief after Yaro passing, despite this, he is unconfident in his ability, but remains dutiful to his position</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Borscht:</strong> This soup features hearty beetroot as its base, combined with tender chunks of beef, potatoes, carrots, and cabbage, simmered in a flavorful broth infused with garlic, dill, and other aromatic spices</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>Mikhail does believes in the Empire propaganda as one of the youth growing up with it, but his compassion for other and loves for Vila compels him to rebel against this notion.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Greeting, I'm Mikhail, I guess I help out a little with everything here and there, it's a pleasure to meet you\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Elder Yaro keeps telling me I'll make a great chief one day. But, I don't know... it feels like an enormous responsibility, you know? I just hope I can live up to his expectations.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Vila...even against everything they teach us, I still wanted to help you.\"</p>",
